entence_id":"holdout3_009_s1","report_id":"holdout3_009","text":"In this report we compare several models on standard benchmarks.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_009_s2","report_id":"holdout3_009","text":"We trained each model for 30 epochs with a batch size of 32.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_009_s3","report_id":"holdout3_009","text":"Each experiment was repeated 5 times with different random seeds.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_009_s4","report_id":"holdout3_009","text":"Figure 1 shows the accuracy during training.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_009_s5","report_id":"holdout3_009","text":"As shown in Figure 1, ViT-S attains a accuracy of 57.7% at epoch 8.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_009_s6","report_id":"holdout3_009","text":"As shown in Figure 1, EfficientNet attains a accuracy of 92.8% at epoch 15.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_009_s7","report_id":"holdout3_009","text":"Figure 2 shows the f1 score during training.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_009_s8","report_id":"holdout3_009","text":"From epoch 8 to epoch 11, the F1 score of Baseline improves by a relative 3.2%.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_009_s9","report_id":"holdout3_009","text":"As shown in Figure 2, Ours outperforms ResNet-50 by 9.7 percentage points at epoch 11.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_009_s10","report_id":"holdout3_009","text":"Ours reaches 74% F1 score at epoch 9 (Figure 2).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_009_s11","report_id":"holdout3_009","text":"As shown in Figure 2, at epoch 5, ResNet-50 achieves 65.2% F1 score.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_009_s12","report_id":"holdout3_009","text":"Figure 3 shows the training loss.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_009_s13","report_id":"holdout3_009","text":"LSTM has a loss of 0.288 at epoch 6.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_009_s14","report_id":"holdout3_009","text":"At epoch 5, the loss of LSTM is 0.228.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_009_s15","report_id":"holdout3_009","text":"LSTM has a loss of 0.621 at epoch 2.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_009_s16","report_id":"holdout3_009","text":"Figure 4 shows the accuracy of Ours by dataset.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_009_s17","report_id":"holdout3_009","text":"Ours scores 13.8 points higher on MNIST than on AG News.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_009_s18","report_id":"holdout3_009","text":"Ours scores 29 points higher on CIFAR-10 than on IMDB.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_009_s19","report_id":"holdout3_009","text":"On IMDB, Ours obtains a accuracy of 94.4%.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_009_s20","report_id":"holdout3_009","text":"On STL-10, Naive Bayes obtains an accuracy of 90.3%.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_009_s21","report_id":"holdout3_009","text":"Overall, the results are in line with what we expected from the literature.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"}]}